# GainWix QA — local-only artifacts.
# The small report (RUN-REPORT-*.html), its JSON sidecar, and RUN-LOG.md ARE
# committed (operational /gx-qa commits). Everything below is local-only.

# Per-run screenshot folders (~30 MB of PNGs each) — note the trailing slash:
# this ignores the RUN-REPORT-<ts>/ directories, NOT the RUN-REPORT-<ts>.html/.json files.
RUN-REPORT-*/

# The runner's installed dependencies + the browser download.
runner/node_modules/
runner/test-results/
